  "primary_text" : "<!doctype html>\n<html><head><title>Trellis CLI Reference</title></head><body>\n<header><nav>Overview Download Community Sponsors</nav></header>\n<h1>Trellis CLI Reference</h1>\n<p>Trellis manages sealed local archives without contacting a remote service.</p>\n<h2>Export options</h2>\n<table>\n  <tr><th>Flag</th><th>Meaning</th></tr>\n  <tr><td>--airgap</td><td>Reject every network-backed resource.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td>--ledger</td><td>Write a SHA-256 inventory beside the archive.</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h2>Exit codes</h2>\n<ul><li>0 — archive completed</li><li>7 — dependency changed during the run</li></ul>\n<form><input placeholder=\"Search docs\"><button>Search</button></form>\n<footer>Apache 2.0 license and compatibility notes</footer>\n</body></html>\n"
